&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;*These benefits apply to direct employees. Benefits may differ for individuals joining through other employment arrangements such as secondments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Annual salary is benchmarked to role scope and relevant experience. Most offers land between £65,000 and £145,000 made up of a base salary plus a technical allowance (take-home salary = base + technical allowance). An additional 28.97% employer pension contribution is paid on the base salary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role sits outside of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ddat-capability-framework.service.gov.uk/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;DDaT pay framework&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;given the scope of this role requires in depth technical&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in frontier AI safety,&amp;nbsp;robustness&amp;nbsp;and advanced AI architectures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The full range of salaries are available below:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 3:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;£65,000–£75,000 (Base £39,850 + Technical Allowance £25,150–£35,150)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 4:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;£85,000–£95,000 (Base £47,355 + Technical Allowance £37,645–£47,645)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 5:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;£105,000–£115,000 (Base £61,620 + Technical Allowance £43,380–£53,380)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 6:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;£125,000–£135,000 (Base £74,605 + Technical Allowance £50,395–£60,395)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level 7:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;£145,000 (Base £74,605 + Technical Allowance £70,395)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Additional Information&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_nullclass&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Applications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Artificial Intelligence can be a useful tool to support your application, however, all examples and statements provided must be truthful, factually accurate and taken directly from your own experience. Where plagiarism has been identified (presenting the ideas and experiences of others, or generated by artificial intelligence, as your own) applications may be withdrawn and internal candidates may be subject to disciplinary action. Please see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.civil-service-careers.gov.uk%2Fartificial-intelligence-and-recruitment%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CLynn.Tan%40dsit.gov.uk%7Ccf5d753b7f19427afc8f08de4c307014%7Ccbac700502c143ebb497e6492d1b2dd8%7C0%7C0%7C639031968075235036%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=jCrYoy62YfXN%2FLIB%2FhtHxdLGbCOgropbkZXDyQsUMC4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;02db05e7-03ca-4ca6-bcd9-73ff8bf258f2&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;candidate guidance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;for more information on appropriate and inappropriate use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Fraud Database&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;The Internal Fraud function of the Fraud, Error, Debt and Grants Function at the Cabinet Office processes details of civil servants who have been dismissed for committing internal fraud, or who would have been dismissed had they not resigned. The Cabinet Office receives the details from participating government organisations of civil servants who have been dismissed, or who would have been dismissed had they not resigned, for internal fraud. In instances such as this, civil servants are then banned for 5 years from further employment in the civil service. The Cabinet Office then processes this data and discloses a limited dataset back to DLUHC as a participating government organisations. DLUHC then carry out the pre employment checks so as to detect instances where known fraudsters are attempting to reapply for roles in the civil service. In this way, the policy is ensured and the repetition of internal fraud is prevented.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;For more information please see -&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/internal-fraud-register-privacy-notice/internal-fraud-register-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Internal Fraud Register.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Successful candidates must undergo a criminal record check and get&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/government-baseline-personnel-security-standard&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/government-baseline-personnel-security-standard&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;baseline personnel security standard (BPSS)&amp;nbsp;clearance&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;before they can be appointed. Additionally, there is a strong preference for eligibility for&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/national-security-vetting-advice-for-people-who-are-being-vetted&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/national-security-vetting-advice-for-people-who-are-being-vetted&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;counter-terrorist check (CTC)&amp;nbsp;clearance&lt;/a&gt;. Some roles may require higher levels of clearance, and we will state this by exception in the job advertisement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/vetting-explained-and-our-vetting-charter/the-vetting-charter&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/vetting-explained-and-our-vetting-charter/the-vetting-charter&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;See our vetting charter here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Nationality requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;We may be able to offer roles to applicant from &lt;strong&gt;any nationality or background&lt;/strong&gt;. As such we encourage you to apply even if you do not meet the standard &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/nationality-rules&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;nationality requirements (opens in a new window).&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Working for the Civil Service&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field_value&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://civilservicecommission.independent.gov.uk/code/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Civil Service Code (opens in a new window)&lt;/a&gt; sets out the standards of behaviour expected of civil servants.&amp;nbsp;The Civil Service embraces diversity and promotes equal opportunities. As such, we run a Disability Confident Scheme (DCS) for candidates with disabilities who meet the minimum selection criteria.&amp;nbsp;The Civil Service also offers a Redeployment Interview Scheme to civil servants who are at risk of redundancy, and who meet the minimum requirements for the advertised vacancy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;vac_display_field_value&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;The Civil Service is committed to attract, retain and invest in talent wherever it is found. To learn more please see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/civil-service-people-plan-2024-2027/civil-service-people-plan-2024-2027-html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Civil Service People Plan (opens in a new window)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/civil-service-diversity-and-inclusion-strategy-2022-to-2025&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Civil Service Diversity and Inclusion Strategy (opens in a new window)&lt;/a&gt;. As part of the application process, we monitor statistics on D&amp;amp;I. You can see how we process this data here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/government-digital-service-recruitment-privacy-notice/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment privacy notice - GOV.UK&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Job Title:&lt;/span&gt; Specialty Doctor in Adult Liaison Psychiatry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Grade:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Specialty Doctor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt; North West England&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Working Hours:&lt;/span&gt; 37.5 hours per week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Rate:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Competitive, to be discussed upon application&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are currently seeking a dedicated Locum Specialty Doctor in Psychiatry to join an adult liaison team. This full-time position offers competitive rates and requires candidates to hold Section 12 approval. The successful applicant will play a vital role in delivering high-quality mental health care within a supportive and dynamic clinical environment. If you&#39;re passionate about making a difference in adult psychiatric care and meet the necessary qualifications, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Qualifications and Experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• GMC registration (essential)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Section 12 approval&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• 3+ Years experience working in a psychiatry position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Excellent communication and teamwork skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid, Holborn Gate, London&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacancy Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent, full time &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Head of Innovation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About STEMAI&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;STEM AI is transforming how life sciences organisations access insights through AI-powered solutions. As our platform expands, we are looking for a Client Success Coordinator to ensure clients move seamlessly from pilot agreement through to successful implementation. This newly created role sits at the heart of the client journey, coordinating complex approval activities and working across technical, legal, commercial and operational teams to remove barriers and accelerate commissioning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Following agreement to pilot STEM AI, clients typically complete multiple internal approval processes covering information security, IT, legal, procurement, compliance, data privacy and operational readiness. Every organisation has different governance requirements, making this a highly collaborative role requiring excellent organisation and stakeholder management.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will become the central point of coordination, ensuring requests are managed efficiently, the right subject matter experts are engaged, responses are prepared to a high standard and clients receive a professional, responsive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate all client approval activities to drive pilot commitment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of contact throughout the implementation approval journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage questionnaires, security assessments and due diligence requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate responses from technical, legal, compliance, commercial and operational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track milestones, manage deadlines and proactively resolve blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare high-quality responses using existing knowledge libraries and previous submissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and continually improve the central repository of approved responses and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular progress updates to internal stakeholders and escalate risks where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to streamline approval activity processes and improve the client experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support successful pilot launches by ensuring approvals are completed accurately and on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About You&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in client success, implementation, project coordination, PMO or programme management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with senior internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative with a proactive, solutions-focused mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within AI, healthcare or life sciences is advantageous but not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Why Join STEMAI?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to help shape a new AI offering from the ground up. You will play a pivotal role in creating a best-in-class client onboarding experience, working alongside innovation, technology and commercial teams to build scalable processes that directly contribute to faster implementations, improved client satisfaction and business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inizio Ignite is the global advisory partner for health and life sciences, encompassing connected expertise across Research Partnership, Putnam, Vynamic, and STEM. Guided by purpose, passion, and precision, we collaborate with clients to ignite impact, accelerate performance, and deliver lasting change for patients. By uniting strategy, insights, and innovation with a unique depth and breadth of expertise, we drive transformation and shape the future of health. Our STEM team uses benchmarking through AI-enabled and evidence-based approaches to drive alignment resulting in accelerated performance. Serving clients across brand &amp;amp; commercial, Medical Affairs &amp;amp; sales, our expertise includes data, research &amp;amp; insights (proprietary benchmarking data), strategic brand alignment, and sales &amp;amp; MSL performance benchmarking. Proudly part of Inizio – the market-leading commercialization partner for health and life sciences. From early-stage development to loss of exclusivity, we simplify complexity, unlock value, and make collaboration seamless at every pivotal moment – supporting confident, insight-driven decisions that move innovation forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find us here:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Website: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.inizio.com/ourbusinesses/ignite&quot;&gt;www.inizio.com/ourbusinesses/ignite&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;STEM Healthcare is an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp; STEM Healthcare will consider all qualified applicants for employment without discrimination on grounds of disability, sex or sexual orientation, pregnancy or maternity leave status, race or national or ethnic origin, age, religion or belief, gender identity or re-assignment, marital or civil partnership status, protected veteran status (if applicable) or any other characteristic protected by law. STEM Healthcare only employs individuals with the right to work in the country/ies where the role is advertised.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every job requirement? That&#39;s okay! Our company is dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive, and authentic workplace. If you&#39;re excited about this role, but your experience doesn&#39;t perfectly fit every qualification, we encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right person for this role or others.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About BakerHicks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BakerHicks is a leading design, engineering and project delivery consultancy, delivering complex infrastructure, industrial and built environment projects across the UK and Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Infrastructure team supports a wide range of clients and frameworks, providing specialist engineering, inspection, surveying and asset management services. As our project portfolio continues to grow, we are expanding our network of trusted contractors to support current and future bridge inspection requirements across the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our strength lies in our collaborative approach, technical excellence, and ability to mobilise the right expertise at pace to support our clients’ requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Bridges Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BakerHicks, our Bridges Team delivers expert engineering solutions across the full lifecycle of bridge and structures projects, from inspection and assessment through to design, refurbishment, strengthening, and replacement works. Our engineers work on a diverse portfolio of assets including highway bridges, railway bridges, footbridges, retaining structures, culverts, and other critical infrastructure across the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We combine technical excellence with a practical, collaborative approach, working closely with clients, asset owners, local authorities, contractors, and multidisciplinary teams to develop safe, sustainable, and cost-effective solutions. Our experience spans inspections, structural assessments, repair schemes, asset management programmes, and the delivery of complex infrastructure projects in highly regulated environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking Expressions of Interest from competent and experienced Bridge and Structural Inspectors to join our growing contractor talent pool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a live vacancy tied to a specific project. Instead, we are building a network of pre-qualified professionals who can be considered for assignments as needs arise across our infrastructure portfolio.&lt;br&gt;Applications are welcomed from anywhere in the UK. Site travel will normally be required, there is no requirement to be based near a BakerHicks office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are particularly keen to hear from inspectors based in Scotland, while welcoming applications from inspectors based in England.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome inspectors with experience in one or more of the following activities and environments:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General inspections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Principal inspections, including close-up examination and access equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Safety, special and reactive inspections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspections for assessment and monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Condition surveys (defect investigations and condition scoring)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highway structures on trunk road and local authority networks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Railway structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspection and access planning, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team leadership and technical review by appropriately qualified Senior Inspectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relevant asset types and construction forms may include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Road and rail bridges, including footbridges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culverts and buried structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retaining walls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tunnel structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sign and signal gantries, masts and other ancillary highway structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structures over or adjacent to watercourses, including scour-related inspections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Concrete, steel, masonry, timber, composite and post-tensioned structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants should be able to demonstrate the following, appropriate to the assignments sought:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant UK bridge or structures inspection experience, with a clear record of inspection roles and asset types&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of applicable standards and client procedures, including NR/L3/CIV/006 and/or DMRB CS 450 where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify, photograph and classify defects; record severity and extent; recognise urgent safety issues; and produce accurate reports and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to plan and coordinate inspection works, including access arrangements and traffic or rail control measures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of structural materials, deterioration mechanisms, structural behaviour and inspection limitations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with National Highways, Transport Scotland, Network Rail, local authorities or comparable asset owners and supply chains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience producing inspection reports and condition assessments, including reporting using Bridge Condition Indicators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT Literacy – proficient in the use of Microsoft Word, Excel and PowerPoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the assignment, the following will be required or advantageous:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current Bridge Inspector Certification Scheme (BICS) certification at Inspector or Senior Inspector level, appropriate to the work. Required where mandated by the client, including relevant Transport Scotland assignments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant BEng/MEng in civil or structural engineering qualification, or equivalent inspection experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current working-at-height and confined-space competence, where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IPAF/MEWP, IRATA rope-access, PASMA mobile access towers, Ladder or other relevant access qualifications, where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current Safe Working Near Water (SWNW) or other equivalent competence, where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current Safe use of Trolley Equipment or Rail Trolley controller, where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid CSCS or other required site-access certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For rail work, current Personal Track Safety (PTS) and other role-specific competences; SSSTS or SMSTS for supervisory duties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network Rail Competencies STE2 – 7 as defined in NR/SP/CTM/017&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Register Your Interest?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining our contractor talent pool, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be considered for assignments matching your competence, location and availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a working relationship with BakerHicks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside experienced infrastructure professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support projects across a variety of sectors, clients and UK locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to Register Your Interest&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please submit your CV. Our Talent Acquisition team will review applications alongside our Infrastructure discipline leaders, and suitable candidates will be invited to an introductory discussion.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract opportunities (Inside IR35 / PAYE engagement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working depending on project requirements (office/site/hybrid)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Locations across the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Many of the positions within our company are subject to security clearance or security assurance levels.&amp;nbsp;The successful candidate must be able to obtain and maintain the appropriate level of security clearance or assurance level for this role, in line with client and sector requirements.&amp;nbsp;In some cases, additional nationality or residency criteria may also apply due to specific client or national security obligations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Further information on National security clearance levels can be found on the UK Government website: (&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/united-kingdom-security-vetting-clearance-levels/national-security-vetting-clearance-levels&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;National security vetting: clearance levels - GOV.UK&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About BakerHicks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve been innovating in design, engineering and project delivery since 1957 and operate from 14 locations for a truly European reach. For more about our company story, see:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://bakerhicks.com/en/about&quot;&gt;About | BakerHicks&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BakerHicks. A&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.morgansindall.com/&quot;&gt;Morgan Sindall Group&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;company.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whatever your discipline, you’ll be alongside some of the most talented people in the industry. Our network of offices are appealing, friendly and comfortable spaces, easily accessible by car or public transport. And our salary and benefits packages are some of the best in the industry.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BakerHicks is an equal opportunity employer. We care about creating an inclusive atmosphere and are committed to promoting diversity and inclusion throughout.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;BakerHicks is an inclusive organisation welcoming talent from all backgrounds. Applicants are assessed on the basis of personal merit and qualifications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Threecolts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Threecolts is the leading software suite for online &amp;amp; offline consumer brands (Amazon, Walmart, Target, Shopify, eBay, etc.). We’ve built a powerful ecosystem of software solutions to help businesses grow smarter — from revenue recovery and retail finance, to multichannel operations and pricing optimization. With over 500 employees globally and strong backing, we’re scaling fast across new markets and new partner channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a global team built for speed, trust, and impact. As an AI enabled company, AI is integrated across Threecolts from development through to operations, empowering teams to move faster, build better, improve quality, and make more informed decisions. We hire exceptional people from all backgrounds and give them the autonomy to move fast and the accountability to deliver, where you will wear multiple hats, take ownership of challenges, and proactively solve problems beyond your immediate scope. Change is constant, ambiguity is part of the deal, and clear, concise communication is how we stay aligned, so when in doubt, bring people in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔥 Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll take ownership of features across Inventory Lab’s C# and Java-based systems, delivering them from initial design through to production. You’ll design and build clean, scalable services, APIs, and components that are maintainable, well-tested, and performant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll operate independently within a defined scope, making sound technical decisions and balancing speed with long-term quality. You’ll play an active role in improving the systems you work on, debugging production issues, identifying root causes, and implementing durable fixes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll contribute to technical discussions, help evolve architecture within your domain, and raise the bar through thoughtful code reviews. Collaboration is key: you’ll work closely with Product, QA, and DevOps to build features and improvements that deliver meaningful value to Inventory Lab customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;😊 About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;5–8+ years of professional software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in C# and Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience building and maintaining backend services, APIs, and scalable application components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of REST APIs, system design, and scalable application patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Experience working with SQL databases and data modelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Familiarity with cloud infrastructure, ideally AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Experience debugging production systems and resolving issues independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Comfortable working with Git, code reviews, and team-based development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Ability to work across an existing codebase and improve quality without over-engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have a strong ownership mindset and consistently deliver high-quality work. You make pragmatic technical decisions, understanding when to prioritise speed and when to invest in scalability, reliability, and maintainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re comfortable working in a product-led environment and care about the customer impact of what you build. You communicate clearly, work well with cross-functional teams, and look for ways to improve both the product and how the team operates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll support Inventory Lab, a product used by ecommerce sellers to manage inventory, listing, accounting, and operational workflows. The work will suit someone who enjoys solving practical product problems, improving reliability, and building systems that support real customer use cases.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⛳️ Compensation, Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Salary: £ 110,000 per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;25 days PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Healthcare &amp;amp; Pension benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Opportunity to join company-wide offsites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Regular rate reviews and bonus opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Fully remote/hybrid working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Threecolts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Threecolts is the leading software suite for online &amp;amp; offline consumer brands (Amazon, Walmart, Target, Shopify, eBay, etc.). We’ve built a powerful ecosystem of software solutions to help businesses grow smarter — from revenue recovery and retail finance, to multichannel operations and pricing optimization. With over 500 employees globally and strong backing, we’re scaling fast across new markets and new partner channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a global team built for speed, trust, and impact. As an AI enabled company, AI is integrated across Threecolts from development through to operations, empowering teams to move faster, build better, improve quality, and make more informed decisions. We hire exceptional people from all backgrounds and give them the autonomy to move fast and the accountability to deliver, where you will wear multiple hats, take ownership of challenges, and proactively solve problems beyond your immediate scope. Change is constant, ambiguity is part of the deal, and clear, concise communication is how we stay aligned, so when in doubt, bring people in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛠️ What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the growth infrastructure that turns traffic into paying customers across Threecolts’ self-serve products, spanning website, funnel conversion, lifecycle, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a senior, hands-on role. Threecolts is deliberately building a lean marketing team that operates at high capacity using AI, which means senior people build as well as lead. You’ll be expected to ship pages, journeys, tests, and improvements directly rather than relying on designers, developers, or large execution teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll own the website and page production layer, including site architecture, page builds, and extending our component library so new pages can launch in days rather than weeks. This is hands-on build work using templates, pre-built components, and AI tooling, not a role focused on writing briefs and handing execution to someone else.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll own conversion across the self-serve funnel, from first session through trial, activation, and paid. You’ll use analytics and behavioural data to understand where the funnel is leaking, identify the highest-impact opportunities, and continuously test and improve performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifecycle also sits within the role. You’ll design and optimise onboarding, activation, retention, and upgrade journeys across a diverse portfolio of products and customer types. Brand owns voice and messaging standards; you own sequencing, triggers, instrumentation, and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll also own the technical foundations that support growth across marketing, including technical SEO, tracking, campaign infrastructure, and product-led instrumentation within the scope of the role. You’ll work closely with Brand, Product, RevOps, and Engineering to make sure growth activity is measurable and scalable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depending on experience, you may also manage a small number of direct reports or external specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 What&#39;s Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience across Growth, Product-Led Growth, Performance Marketing, Web, or related roles within SaaS, e-commerce, or digital businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on ability to build and launch landing pages without relying on a designer or developer for day-to-day execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with modern CMS, component-based page systems, no-code or low-code tooling, and AI-assisted build workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong CRO experience, with a track record of improving conversion across self-serve funnels using analytics, experimentation, and behavioural insight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real product-led growth experience, including trial-to-paid conversion, activation, onboarding, and lifecycle optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytics fluency, with the ability to independently diagnose funnel performance and prioritise opportunities by commercial impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and optimising lifecycle and email journeys based on behavioural triggers rather than purely campaign-led sends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely hands-on experience using AI tools to build, test, analyse, instrument, and increase execution speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial literacy, with a working understanding of CAC, conversion rate, payback, retention, and unit economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in fast-paced, lean environments where senior people are expected to execute as well as set direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional working skills, particularly across Product, Brand, RevOps, Engineering, and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on growth operator who is equally comfortable building the infrastructure and improving the numbers that sit on top of it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think about conversion as a commercial outcome, not a collection of marketing tasks. You can move from identifying a funnel problem in the data to building and shipping the page, journey, or test needed to improve it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are technically confident enough to work independently. You do not need a designer or developer to ship every change, and you actively use templates, components, automation, and AI to increase your own capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand product-led growth in practice, particularly the mechanics of turning trial users into activated, paying customers. You see lifecycle as a growth lever rather than simply an email channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are commercially minded and comfortable thinking in CAC, conversion, payback, and revenue impact. You can prioritise work based on where it will create the greatest return rather than where there is the loudest internal request.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Most importantly, you want ownership of a system rather than ownership of a large team. You are comfortable being in the detail, building alongside others, and creating the infrastructure the rest of marketing depends on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;💰 Compensation, Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £ 80,000 per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare &amp;amp; Pension benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to join company-wide offsites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular rate reviews and bonus opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully remote/hybrid working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Threecolts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Threecolts is the leading software suite for online &amp;amp; offline consumer brands (Amazon, Walmart, Target, Shopify, eBay, etc.). We’ve built a powerful ecosystem of software solutions to help businesses grow smarter — from revenue recovery and retail finance, to multichannel operations and pricing optimization. With over 500 employees globally and strong backing, we’re scaling fast across new markets and new partner channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a global team built for speed, trust, and impact. As an AI enabled company, AI is integrated across Threecolts from development through to operations, empowering teams to move faster, build better, improve quality, and make more informed decisions. We hire exceptional people from all backgrounds and give them the autonomy to move fast and the accountability to deliver, where you will wear multiple hats, take ownership of challenges, and proactively solve problems beyond your immediate scope. Change is constant, ambiguity is part of the deal, and clear, concise communication is how we stay aligned, so when in doubt, bring people in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛠️ What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own how Threecolts shows up in the market across positioning, content, social, and external communications, helping sellers and brands understand who we are and why our products matter before they ever speak to us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a senior, hands-on role. Threecolts is deliberately building a lean marketing team that operates at high capacity using AI, which means senior people build as well as lead. You’ll spend significant time producing, editing, and shaping work directly rather than managing a large team or delegating execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across a diverse portfolio, from SMB products such as Seller 365 and AI Operator through to enterprise propositions including Margin Pro and Retail 365, you’ll develop positioning and messaging that reflects the very different needs, buying criteria, and language of each audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A core part of the role is building a scalable positioning system across the portfolio, grounded in genuine marketplace insight. That means understanding not only what each ICP values, but what they do not care about, and avoiding generic SaaS messaging that tries to speak to everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll own our pillar content and editorial approach, developing substantial pieces of content that can be repurposed across channels and formats. Keyword, topic, and SEO strategy also sit within the role, informed by a strong understanding of our audiences and the questions they are trying to answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll own Threecolts’ social presence, PR activity, and influencer approach, shaping the register and narrative we use across external channels. You’ll work closely with Growth and other Marketing teams, setting strong messaging and content foundations that can be applied across campaigns and acquisition activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll also play a significant role in maintaining the quality of what Threecolts puts into the market, using strong editorial judgement to produce and review a high volume of work without slowing the organisation down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depending on experience, the role may also manage a small number of direct reports or flexible external production resource.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 What&#39;s Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience across Brand, Content, Product Marketing, or related marketing roles within e-commerce, marketplace, or B2B SaaS environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep marketplace e-commerce knowledge, with a strong understanding of how Amazon, Walmart, and other marketplace sellers and brands operate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing differentiated positioning and messaging across multiple products, audiences, or ICPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate effectively to very different audiences, from independent marketplace sellers through to senior stakeholders within enterprise consumer brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong editorial judgement, with the ability to assess, improve, and produce high-quality work quickly across multiple formats and channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely hands-on experience using AI tools to research, create, edit, repurpose, and scale marketing output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong content strategy experience, including editorial planning, SEO, keyword strategy, and content distribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning or contributing significantly to social, PR, influencer, or external communications strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial literacy, with an understanding of how brand, positioning, and content contribute to pipeline, conversion, adoption, and revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a fast-paced, lean environment where senior people are expected to build as well as set direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written communication skills, with the ability to move confidently between different audiences, tones, and levels of complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A senior marketing operator with deep marketplace knowledge and strong instinct for how products should be positioned and communicated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who can move comfortably between a solopreneur running an Amazon business and a Brand Director at a global consumer company, understanding that the language, priorities, and proof points that resonate with each are fundamentally different.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong taste but you are not precious about the process. You can apply editorial judgement quickly, recognise what is good enough to ship, and improve output without becoming a bottleneck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly hands-on and actively use AI to increase your own capacity. You see AI as part of how modern marketing teams operate, not as a separate initiative or something delegated to junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are commercially minded and understand that brand and content ultimately need to contribute to growth. You are comfortable discussing pipeline, conversion, attribution, and revenue alongside positioning, narrative, and creative quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Most importantly, you want meaningful ownership rather than a bigger team. You are comfortable working in the detail, producing alongside others, and using technology and judgement to achieve more than the size of the team would suggest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;💰 Compensation, Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary £ 80,000 per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare &amp;amp; Pension benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to join company-wide offsites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular rate reviews and bonus opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully remote/hybrid working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About the role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Director, Product Management&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to lead the strategy and execution of WPP’s next-generation Agentic Data Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within Cohort Solutions, you will own product vision, strategy, roadmap development and execution across multiple products and initiatives. You will partner closely with Engineering, Data Science, Data Operations, Commercial, Partnerships, Governance and Market teams to deliver scalable, high-impact products that create measurable business value and strong adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will combine disciplined product management with experience in data products, AI, commercialization, stakeholder management and cross-functional leadership. The final role level will reflect the scope of the position and the experience of the successful candidate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Why we’re hiring&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To establish and execute a clear product strategy for WPP’s Agentic Data Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To turn complex data and AI capabilities into scalable products that solve meaningful business and customer problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To connect product investment, adoption and commercialization with measurable value across WPP’s global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product vision, strategy and roadmap across multiple data platform products and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer, user, market and business needs into clear product priorities and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead products through discovery, validation, development, launch, adoption and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering, Data Science, Data Operations, Commercial, Partnerships, Governance and Market teams to deliver high-quality products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success measures and use data to track adoption, value, quality, cost and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop product economics and commercialization approaches, balancing customer value, business objectives, speed, quality and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance AI, agent and workflow automation opportunities through responsible experimentation, while ensuring appropriate governance, privacy, security and data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How your time may be focused&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is expected to be approximately&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;70% individual contribution and 30% leadership/management&lt;/strong&gt;, with the balance adapting to business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create alignment around a compelling product vision and prioritized roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move complex data and AI initiatives from strategy into valuable, adopted products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear measures for product performance, customer value and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships across technical, commercial, governance and market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop product talent and strengthen product management practices across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who you’ll be working with&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work across a global, matrixed environment with colleagues in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering and Data Science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Operations and Governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial and Partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product, technology and senior executive leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant product management experience, including ownership of strategy, roadmaps and product lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building or scaling products in one or more of the following areas: data, analytics, advertising technology, Martech, SaaS, AI or enterprise platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking products from strategy and discovery through delivery, launch, adoption and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex, cross-functional product initiatives or teams within a matrixed or global organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgment, including the ability to connect customer needs with product economics, revenue drivers, costs and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence senior stakeholders and create alignment across technical and non-technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of enterprise data platforms and the ability to collaborate effectively with Engineering and Data Science colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that would be valuable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or launching agentic, AI-native or workflow automation products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of LLMs, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) and agent orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with responsible AI, data governance, privacy or security considerations in enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading, coaching or developing product managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value relevant skills and experience gained through different career paths. Equivalent professional experience will be considered in place of rigid formal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;How you lead&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic thinker:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You connect product investments to business outcomes and build compelling, actionable roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially minded:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You understand value creation, customer needs, product economics and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influential collaborator:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You build trust across functions, navigate competing priorities and resolve conflicts constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution focused:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You make informed decisions in ambiguous environments and balance speed, quality and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced Treasury Systems leader to shape and deliver the future of Treasury technology at WPP.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Reporting into Group Treasury, you&#39;ll lead the management, optimisation and transformation of our global treasury systems landscape, supporting the delivery of Elevate28, WPP&#39;s strategic transformation programme. You&#39;ll work across Treasury, Finance, Technology, regional teams and external partners to drive automation, improve controls, enhance reporting, and deliver major system initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The role will oversee cross-regional transformation projects, ensuring successful delivery of complex system and process changes while managing risks, dependencies, resources, and key stakeholder decisions. You will also play a pivotal role in Treasury Systems governance, leading change request management, supporting Steering Committee activities, and helping shape the future operating model of the Treasury function.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact role with the opportunity to influence the future operating model of Treasury Systems at a global scale while leading a team based in Bengaluru.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
