&lt;h4&gt;Key Systems Expertise&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;Strong&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;experience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;Treasury&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;Management&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;Systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;ideally&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;ION&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;IT2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;Expertise&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;treasury&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;technology,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;banking&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;connectivity,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;system&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;including&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;SWIFT,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;APIs,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;host-to-host&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to shape the future Treasury technology landscape within a global organisation, driving strategic change while delivering tangible business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience implementing, managing, or supporting Treasury Management Systems within a corporate or financial services environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of UK and international treasury operations, including cash management, liquidity, financial instruments, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated project management expertise, with a track record of delivering complex transformation and systems initiatives on time and within budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical skills, including strong proficiency in Excel, reporting tools, and data-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating treasury platforms with ERPs, banking systems, and payment networks is highly advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive problem solver with a strong focus on process optimisation, controls, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to influence and collaborate effectively at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working both independently and as part of a global, fast-paced team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An appreciation of emerging technologies, including the application of AI to enhance treasury operations, insights, and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Data &amp;amp; Technology Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP’s Data &amp;amp; Technology Solutions is the WPP’s unified global data products and technology team. We work with our agencies and clients to build data data-driven solutions and technology product to power marketing transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Open is our AI platform for marketing, it connects marketing professionals, data, tools and AI in a single place. WPP Open is the simplest, safest and fastest way to realize the benefits of scaled AI – delivering better-informed creative ideas faster, at scale and at lower cost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re endlessly curious and our team of thinkers, builders, creators and problem solvers are over 2,000 strong, across 20 markets around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a strategic and commercially driven leader to oversee data enablement for key clients. The ideal candidate will bring deep experience managing strategic data vendor relationships and accelerating their growth within a global organization, while collaborating effectively across cross-functional teams to align stakeholders and deliver new initiatives. This individual will be responsible for managing revenue pacing against targets, building and scaling workflows for data accessibility, and overseeing contractual requirements. A strong project manager, they will confidently engage and mobilize teams across the organization to drive execution and deliver impactful results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Vendor Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage strategic data vendors and accelerate their growth across WPP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for vendors and WPP, project managing and aligning stakeholders for new initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue &amp;amp; Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and maintain pacing of revenue alongside the Open Audiences team to ensure delivery against targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow &amp;amp; Product Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain workflows of data accessibility across WPP tools, including scoping product requirements to scale data assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contractual Oversight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and maintain contractual relationships and requirements with data vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the sole person responsible for engaging the right teams across the organization to execute new deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a leadership role focused on data enablement, vendor management, or partnership operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of contractual processes and legal requirements associated with data partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design and implement effective operational processes and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with a focus on data-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a matrixed, global organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are ready to be at the forefront of the AdTech industry, shaping its future, and driving success for both our clients, we encourage you to apply and join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;accelerating&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;the&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;adoption&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;across&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;the&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;enterprise,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;investing&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;portfolio&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;strategic&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;initiatives&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;designed&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;transform&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;how&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;work&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;gets&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;done&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;across&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;our&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;global&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within Enterprise Technology, we&#39;re enabling this transformation by &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;building&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;the&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;platforms,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;capabilities&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;operating&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;models&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;that&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;will&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;power&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;the&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;next&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;generation&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;work.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;From&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;Microsoft&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;Copilot&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;intelligent&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;automation&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;emerging&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;technologies&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;agentic&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;workflows,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;we&#39;re&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;embedding&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;into&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;the&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;fabric&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;how&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;operates&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;We&#39;re&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;looking&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;Programme&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;Lead&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;(Value&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;Delivery)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;help&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;ensure&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;those&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;investments&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;translate&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;into&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;measurable&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;business&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the heart of WPP&#39;s Enterprise AI programme, owning the critical link between delivery and impact. While delivery teams focus on building AI solutions, you&#39;ll focus on proving and maximising &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;their&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;value,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;ensuring&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;solutions&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;become&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;embedded&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;into&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;the&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;way&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;people&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;work&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;that&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;are&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;measured,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;evidenced&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;sustained&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;over&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work with senior business stakeholders and functional leaders&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;shape&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;investment&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;decisions,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;drive&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;adoption&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;at&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;scale&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;ensure&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;realises&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;the&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;full&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;value&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___1cs5bdp f1w7gpdv f5p0z4x&quot;&gt;its&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;___xxxjie0 f1w7gpdv f1gqqdtu&quot;&gt;ambitions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
