&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Senior Manager, Global HR Compliance &lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our People team are the architects of a great workplace where brilliant minds come together to do their best work. From discovering diverse talent and nurturing future leaders, to creating spaces that spark collaboration and crafting rewards that celebrate success - we&#39;re passionate about building a culture where everyone can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Manager, People Operations &amp;amp; HR Compliance to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us define and lead our global HR compliance strategy across 30,000+ employees and 40+ countries—building a proactive, AI-enabled compliance function that is a trusted partner to the business and a clear enabler of how we grow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-people-team/&quot;&gt;People team&lt;/a&gt; — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Global People Operations team. The Global HR Compliance team is a critical capability within Global People Operations, owning the strategy, governance, and execution of employment compliance across the DoorDash brand ecosystem. This is a high-impact team operating at the intersection of legal obligation and people strategy, partnering closely with Legal, People Business Partners, Compensation, People Services, and People Technology to ensure that how we operate as an employer reflects both our values and our obligations. You’ll lead and grow an existing team of experienced compliance professionals and report directly to the Sr. Director, Head of Global People Operations, serving also as a strategic partner and right hand on the highest-priority cross-functional people operations initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and own the global HR compliance strategy&lt;/strong&gt; establishing a clear vision, operating model, and multi-year roadmap that is well understood across the People team and actively aligned to business priorities across the brand ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, develop, and grow the global HR Compliance team&lt;/strong&gt;, setting clear goals, creating mechanisms to communicate progress, and building a high-trust function that is known for proactive partnership rather than reactive oversight.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive the execution of a robust compliance program&lt;/strong&gt; across core domains including SOX hire-to-retire controls, legislation management, mandated compliance reporting, employment handbook and policy governance, background checks, work authorisation, wage and hour, leave of absence, and employee data privacy ensuring consistent coverage across all geographies and brands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed AI and automation into the core workflows&lt;/strong&gt; of the compliance function using technology to enhance monitoring, streamline documentation, surface risk earlier, and scale the team’s capacity to operate proactively across a complex, global landscape.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and maintain strong cross-functional partnerships&lt;/strong&gt; with Employment Legal, People Business Partners, Compensation, and People Technology creating clear engagement models so that the right stakeholders know when and how to activate the Global HR Compliance team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop governance mechanisms and compliance reporting&lt;/strong&gt; that provide transparency into program health, surface emerging risks, and demonstrate measurable impact across the compliance roadmap—creating clear visibility for People leadership and key cross-functional partners.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a strategic partner and right hand&lt;/strong&gt; to the Sr. Director, Head of Global People Operations—driving operating rhythm, cross-functional prioritisation, and alignment across the Global People Operations leadership team on the highest-priority initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant experience leading HR compliance or employment law programs&lt;/strong&gt; in a high-growth, global technology company or similar fast-paced environment—with a strong track record of building and leading compliance functions at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep expertise across core HR compliance domains&lt;/strong&gt; including employment legislation management, SOX hire-to-retire controls, mandated reporting, policy governance, work authorisation, data privacy, and wage and hour—with the ability to navigate both UK/EMEA specifics and broader global complexity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability as a strategic operator&lt;/strong&gt; who can define a multi-year compliance vision and gain stakeholder buy-in, while also rolling up their sleeves to build process infrastructure, drive execution, and deliver against a roadmap with urgency and rigour.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated experience embedding AI and automation&lt;/strong&gt; into compliance or people operations workflows—with a clear point of view on how technology can be used to scale a proactive, intelligence-driven approach to employment compliance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong leadership and cross-functional influence skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with a history of building trusted partnerships with Legal, HR, Finance, and Technology teams—and a proven ability to create clarity and alignment in complex, matrixed, multinational organisations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Senior Manager, Corporate Services Sourcing&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Finance team shapes the company&#39;s future by directing capital to high-impact investments, developing robust financial strategies, and ensuring we deliver long-term value while pursuing our ambitious mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Manager, Corporate Services Sourcing to join our team. This is a remote role based in Europe (preferred hubs: London, Berlin, Copenhagen, or Helsinki). In this role, you’ll help us lead the Corporate Services Sourcing team for the Deliveroo and Wolt brands, driving strategic category management and delivering commercial value across a multi-million-pound indirect spend portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-finance-team/&quot;&gt;Finance&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Global Sourcing team within our Global Procurement organization, reporting into the Director, Head of Global Strategic Sourcing. You will lead a team of five (5) managing a broad portfolio across EMEA (including Professional Services, Global Security, Facilities/Real Estate, BPO, HR/Benefits, and Contingent Workforce), while partnering with the DoorDash Corporate Services team to capture global enterprise synergies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Category Strategy &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing sourcing team&lt;/strong&gt; of five, setting clear goals, driving accountability, and building capability across the Corporate Services portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and execute multi-year category strategies&lt;/strong&gt; that increase category maturity, optimise total cost of ownership (TCO), and unlock value beyond traditional cost savings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with DoorDash sourcing leads&lt;/strong&gt; to align global category strategies, leverage enterprise scale across brands, and capture cross-regional synergies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Execution &amp;amp; Supplier Management&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the end-to-end sourcing lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt; for high-stakes corporate procurement, including data analysis, RFx creation, proposal evaluation, and complex contract negotiations (MSAs/SOWs).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a trusted advisor and escalation point&lt;/strong&gt; for executive stakeholders across G&amp;amp;A functions (Finance, Legal, HR, Security) and core business lines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish best-in-class supplier ecosystems&lt;/strong&gt;, tracking performance, SLAs, and supplier risk while embedding ethical and sustainable sourcing (ESG) practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to procurement transformation initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;, championing new tooling, AI-driven sourcing workflows, and continuous process improvements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Essential&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant experience in Corporate Services Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;, with a proven track record of developing and executing strategic category plans across indirect spend categories.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated people management capability&lt;/strong&gt;, with experience leading, mentoring, and developing high-performing sourcing professionals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong commercial and negotiation acumen&lt;/strong&gt;, with proven ability to structure and negotiate complex commercial agreements (MSAs, SOWs) and utilise TCO modelling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional stakeholder engagement and communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;, capable of influencing senior leaders, managing matrixed business partners, and driving cross-brand collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep risk management expertise&lt;/strong&gt;, including third-party risk assessments, contract governance, and mitigation strategies within multi-jurisdictional environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience working within the technology sector or high-growth, fast-paced marketplace environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with modern procurement and CLM platforms (e.g., Coupa, NetSuite, Pivot) and enthusiasm for applying AI tools in day-to-day sourcing workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience operating across European markets and diverse regulatory/legal structures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Commercial Enablement &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Manager: &lt;/strong&gt;Nico Daskalakis&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter: &lt;/strong&gt;Tamsin Clarry&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London or EMEA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; 7&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Manager, Commercial Enablement to build and lead our Commercial Enablement function across 37 EMEA markets. Sitting at the heart of our EMEA Merchant organisation, you&#39;ll lead a multi-disciplinary pod spanning Commercial Learning &amp;amp; Development, Analytics and Commercial Incentives, equipping our Merchant Sales, Account Management, and Support teams with the insights, capabilities, tools, and incentives they need to execute consistently and deliver exceptional merchant outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role for a pragmatic senior operator who thrives on turning commercial strategy into scalable systems — someone who can build high-performing teams, navigate ambiguity, and drive measurable improvements in frontline productivity, training effectiveness, and incentive performance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-commercial-team/&quot;&gt;Commercial&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll oversee the design and delivery of learning programs that build the skills, knowledge, and confidence Sales, Account Management, and Support teams need to execute consistently across markets — from new hire onboarding and role-based learning paths to manager enablement and targeted capability-building tied to commercial priorities. You&#39;ll partner closely with commercial leaders and central People, HR, and L&amp;amp;D teams to ensure programs are practical, measurable, and integrated into the broader company learning agenda.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Incentives:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll own the design, rollout, and operation of incentive programs that align frontline behaviour with selection, growth, quality, profitability, and merchant outcome goals — ensuring plans are commercially sound, easy to understand, and operationally scalable. You&#39;ll also drive continuous improvement in incentive governance, documentation, controls, dispute resolution, and performance measurement, with accurate tracking and on-time payouts throughout.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll be responsible for providing trusted, actionable performance insights to commercial leaders and frontline teams. You will ensure leaders and teams have access to clear dashboards, validated metrics, consistent definitions, and reporting that helps them identify priority merchants, performance gaps, execution opportunities, and areas requiring intervention. You will partner closely with Data Science, Engineering, Analytics, and business stakeholders to improve data availability, data quality, metric consistency, and reporting adoption.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a seasoned commercial, strategy, operations, or enablement leader with a track record of operating at scale across complex, multi-country markets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years&#39; experience&lt;/strong&gt; in strategy consulting, commercial strategy, revenue operations, sales operations, merchant operations, or a related field&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record of leading multi-disciplinary, multi-country teams&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally spanning analytics, learning &amp;amp; development, program management, and incentive design&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;commercial judgment&lt;/strong&gt; and a relentless drive to connect enablement work to measurable business outcomes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A bias for action&lt;/strong&gt; — pragmatic, hands-on, and comfortable navigating ambiguity&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience building scalable operating models&lt;/strong&gt;, processes, governance, and performance management systems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A proven ability to&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;design and deliver L&amp;amp;D programs&lt;/strong&gt; for Sales, Account Management, and Support teams&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong analytical fluency&lt;/strong&gt; — defining metrics, challenging data quality, and turning insight into action&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on experience with incentive programs, sales compensation&lt;/strong&gt;, variable pay, or other performance-based reward mechanisms&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent stakeholder managemen&lt;/strong&gt;t and communication skills, with the ability to distill complexity and align diverse audiences around clear decisions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes &lt;strong&gt;4-5 stages&lt;/strong&gt;. Find more about how we hire &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;br&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;br&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before applying, please familiarise yourself with &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1s4S_1COUrs9JlqgZZAwJiw7EOQq08j0Y8pEOmka1tcQ/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.uo7hwajhjsqa&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliveroo&#39;s internal mobility policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If this feels like the right next step in your Deliveroo journey, we&#39;d love to chat – even if you don&#39;t tick every box. We&#39;re here to support your growth and help you deliver possibility in new ways.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivering Possibility — ready to help shape the future of delivery? Apply today.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Senior Manager, Accounting&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Finance team shapes the company&#39;s future by directing capital to high-impact investments, developing robust financial strategies, and ensuring we deliver long-term value while pursuing our ambitious mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Manager, Accounting to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us strengthen our general ledger and accounting operations functions while driving alignment with global financial processes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-finance-team/&quot;&gt;Finance&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Accounting sub-team, reporting to the International Controller. It’s an exciting time to join our rapidly growing team, where you will manage day-to-day general ledger operations, ensure robust internal controls, and partner with cross-functional leaders to keep pace within one of the fastest-growing marketplace companies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Manage day-to-day accounting activities to ensure compliance with U.S. GAAP, internal policies, SOX controls, and external audits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Integrate general ledger accounting operations to drive alignment with global processes across the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Share ownership of the full-cycle general ledger financial close process, reviewing journal entries and account reconciliations to ensure complete and accurate financials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive process improvement and automation initiatives to streamline accounting operations and refine monthly, quarterly, and annual close cycles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Act as a key decision-maker in the continuous development of accounting policies, standard operating procedures, and monthly variance analysis in partnership with FP&amp;amp;A and Financial Reporting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Extensive public company accounting experience within a relevant industry, alongside proven experience managing and developing staff.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strong technical knowledge of U.S. GAAP, IFRS, PCAOB standards, and SOX internal controls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proven track record of managing full-cycle financial close processes and maintaining robust accounting operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, ACA/ACCACPA qualification, or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience working with financial systems such as NetSuite, Coupa, and GSuite.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Senior Machine Learning Engineer&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Engineering teams tackle complex technical challenges across a global, three-sided marketplace, building and scaling systems that serve millions of customers, riders and partners every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From real-time logistics to resilient infrastructure and marketplace optimisation, we design, build and operate technology that powers Deliveroo’s growth at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for several &lt;strong&gt;Senior Machine Learning Engineers&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; teams. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll help us develop the algorithmic and machine-learning systems that power Deliveroo, making automated decisions at massive scale across our three-sided marketplace. Based on the team you join, here&#39;s what your role may look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Verticals&lt;/strong&gt; – developing recommendation and catalogue-quality models that help customers discover the right grocery and retail items while supporting growth and efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Care&lt;/strong&gt; – building ML and LLM-powered systems that support customer care operations, from understanding intent and sentiment to suggesting fair and consistent resolutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Merchants&lt;/strong&gt; – owning and evolving core ML models that support our merchant ecosystem (for example around classification, matching and lead-scoring), and building new models and AI agents that help partners grow their business.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Irrespective of the team, you will:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and build sophisticated machine learning models&lt;/strong&gt; to solve fuzzy business problems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Productionise end-to-end ML solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, moving from initial concept to shipping code that drives measurable impact on our global marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate in cross-functional squads&lt;/strong&gt; alongside software engineers, data scientists, and product managers to build intelligent decision-making machines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor junior colleagues&lt;/strong&gt; and contribute to our robust technical review process to maintain high engineering standards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant experience applying algorithmic solutions&lt;/strong&gt; to complex business problems at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding of machine learning fundamentals&lt;/strong&gt; and a proven ability to know when and how to apply them effectively.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated ownership of end-to-end model productionisation&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong background in software engineering principles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A bias for simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; and a focus on achieving tangible business impact over theoretical complexity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional programming and statistical skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to translate ambiguous objectives into technical reality.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering/&quot;&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/interview-guide-for-engineers/&quot;&gt;Explore our Engineering Interview Guide here&lt;/a&gt; to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Senior Manager, Finance &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Finance team shapes the company&#39;s future by directing capital to high-impact investments, developing robust financial strategies, and ensuring we deliver long-term value while pursuing our ambitious mission. If you thrive in fast-paced environments and want to model the future of a global tech brand—this is the team for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Finance &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you’ll play an integral part in building our business strategy, ensuring we make the most efficient investment and capital allocation decisions to accelerate our global growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-finance-team/&quot;&gt;Finance&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the &lt;strong&gt;Finance &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; team. We partner cross-functionally to improve the profitability, scalability, and defensibility of our business model, carrying projects from initial conception through to final execution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Decision Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with stakeholders across the business to develop new investment decision-making frameworks and drive strategy in a dynamic environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth vs. Profitability:&lt;/strong&gt; Own complex models and analyses to help the business strike the optimal balance between aggressive growth and long-term profitability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Custom Financial Modelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead high-impact modelling exercises to support key initiatives, sizing new opportunities and building business cases for innovative products.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Track and analyse key financial and business KPIs to uncover trends, assessing current and future risks while identifying new market opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead special projects to automate and scale our forecasting and reporting tools, ensuring our methodologies evolve alongside the business.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with operators and departmental leaders to develop new policies and ensure day-to-day execution aligns with our financial targets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Finance Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant experience (typically 8+ years) in strategic finance, corporate finance, or investment banking, ideally within a high-growth tech environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of managing and mentoring teams; you are passionate about building a high-performing &quot;gold standard&quot; finance function.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influencing Power:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to earn the trust of senior leaders and influence strategic thinking across a matrixed organisation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced Excel/Google Sheets skills with the ability to build robust, complex financial models that distill data into digestible insights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience owning forecasts and budgets for major functional areas, working directly with operators to hit performance targets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in SQL (or a strong willingness to learn) to manipulate large datasets and uncover hidden business insights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Finance team shapes the company&#39;s future by directing capital to high-impact investments, developing robust financial strategies, and ensuring we deliver long-term value while pursuing our ambitious mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Finance Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you’ll lead key aspects of the reporting and accounting process, ensuring our financial operations remain robust and scalable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get to know our&lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-finance-team/&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;Finance&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the &lt;strong&gt;Europe Accounting&lt;/strong&gt; team. This team acts as the engine room for our financial integrity, bridging the gap between local operations and global reporting standards during an exciting period of integration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Reporting Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead month-end and quarter-end close activities, ensuring all financial reporting deliverables are accurate, timely, and aligned with US headquarters requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the review of journal entries, balance sheet reconciliations, and variance analysis to maintain the highest standards of financial accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify process gaps and implement scalable controls to strengthen financial governance and shorten close cycles across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnering:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with cross-functional stakeholders in Operations and regional teams to streamline accounting workflows and improve data quality.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate internal and external audit requests while maintaining comprehensive documentation for key accounting processes and SOPs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Qualification:&lt;/strong&gt; ACA, ACCA, CIMA or equivalent accountancy qualification with at least 4 years of post-qualified experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant post-qualification experience within a complex, fast-paced financial environment, ideally with a focus on group reporting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of NetSuite (or equivalent ERP systems) and financial reporting tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to partner with cross-functional teams and influence senior leaders across different regions and functions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; A proactive mindset with the ability to navigate ambiguity and drive outcomes in an evolving global business environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire&lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-ID1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;It’s an exciting time to join our rapidly growing Accounting team with ample development opportunities. We&#39;re growing the Revenue Data team with Engineering and Accounting Data openings to drive our automation and systems infrastructure and while keeping pace within one of the fastest growing marketplace companies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Senior Engineer for Accounting Infrastructure and Systems designs, builds, and maintains the scalable backend services, data pipelines, and integrations that power DoorDash&#39;s accounting, reconciliation, and financial reporting workflows. Working closely with Finance, Accounting, and fellow engineers, this role translates complex financial and regulatory requirements into reliable, automated systems that ensure accuracy, auditability, and compliance at scale. The ideal candidate brings strong distributed-systems and data engineering expertise along with a solid understanding of financial processes, and takes technical ownership of critical projects while mentoring junior engineers and helping shape the team&#39;s architecture and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take technical ownership of critical accounting infrastructure projects — designing and building the backend services, data pipelines, and integrations that power DoorDash&#39;s financial reporting, reconciliation, and close workflows at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner directly with Finance and Accounting stakeholders to translate complex financial and regulatory requirements into reliable, auditable, and automated systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shape the team&#39;s architecture and engineering best practices, mentoring junior engineers and raising the technical bar across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive measurable improvements in data accuracy, pipeline reliability, and system performance in a high-impact, compliance-critical environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You have 5+ years of experience in software or data engineering, with a strong track record of owning and delivering complex backend or data infrastructure projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You have deep expertise in distributed systems and data engineering, with hands-on experience in tools like Snowflake, dbt, Fivetran, or similar modern data stack technologies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can navigate the intersection of engineering and finance — understanding concepts like revenue recognition, reconciliation, and auditability well enough to build systems that meet those requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You have a collaborative, low-ego approach and can effectively partner with both technical and non-technical stakeholders across Finance, Accounting, and Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with SOX controls, data quality frameworks, or financial systems (e.g., NetSuite) is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At DoorDash, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a massive marketplace that’s constantly evolving. By joining our London-based team on a Deliveroo contract, you get the unique advantage of working within a vibrant local business environment while directly blueprinting global-scale processes for the broader DoorDash Inc. group.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re problem solvers, community builders, and innovators, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for merchants, consumers, partners, and dashers/riders worldwide by building clean, frictionless operational workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace, and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role:&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills, and grow as the global business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;DoorDash brings together brands and teams with massive reach, scale, and ambition. In this role, you &lt;strong&gt;will&lt;/strong&gt; collaborate directly with teammates, systems, and leaders across our entire global footprint, including Deliveroo, Wolt, and DoorDash US. Together, we are unlocking new possibilities and driving global impact as one unified team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-ID1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to transform the way people shop and eat, bringing the neighbourhood to your door by connecting consumers, restaurants, shops and riders. We are a technology-driven company at the forefront of one of the most rapidly expanding industries in the world: a complex, always-on, three-sided marketplace that impacts millions of people every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we&#39;re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;BizOps is the team that keeps its finger on the pulse of business performance: continuously, rigorously, and across multiple dimensions at once. We turn raw operational and financial data into actionable intelligence, surfacing &lt;em&gt;what&lt;/em&gt; is happening, &lt;em&gt;why&lt;/em&gt; it is happening, and &lt;em&gt;what to expect next&lt;/em&gt;, for the operators, executives, and functional teams who run the business day to day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are not a reporting function that produces outputs on request. We work continuously, proactively watching, delivering, and questioning whether the signal is real, acting as &quot;first responders&quot; to surprising deviations from expectation and using what we learn to drive faster, better decision-making for the business at large.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our work spans the full stack of analytics: from the warehouse models that make metrics trustworthy, to the monitoring systems that catch problems early, to the reports and dashboards that make performance visible, to the deep-dive investigations that explain what the numbers mean and what we should do about it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We anchor our analysis to the right reference points: how performance compares to plan, to prior periods, and to what we&#39;d expect, and we bring causal rigour when the business needs to know whether an action actually worked.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The culture within the team is informal, fast-paced and entrepreneurial. Given the growth of the business and the level of senior stakeholder exposure, progression in the team can be fast.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is hiring a Senior Data Scientist to join BizOps, based in our London HQ (hybrid, minimum three days per week in the office).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role is largely project-based: starting from a strategic or performance question, you&#39;ll combine data, business context, and structured problem-solving to provide the insights that drive decision-making at a global level with senior stakeholders. You will own delivery end-to-end, from the messy, ambiguous question to a rigorous, trustworthy, and actionable answer.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be equally comfortable building the systems that make performance visible and going deep on the investigations that explain it. One week you might diagnose why a key market has moved away from plan; the next, identify the drivers behind a change in customer or operational performance; the next, build monitoring that helps teams spot and understand emerging issues earlier.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires building effective working relationships across Deliveroo, particularly with international markets, as well as the Data Science, Operations, Commercial, and Finance teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Answer the questions that matter, continuously.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a rigorous view on business performance: &lt;em&gt;Are we on track against our goals? What&#39;s changed? How does this compare with what we expected? What should we expect next?&lt;/em&gt; Then go further: &lt;em&gt;Why is it happening, what matters most, and what should we do about it?”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own delivery end-to-end.&lt;/strong&gt; Independently identify, define, and deliver impactful work aligned with business goals, operating with minimal guidance to ship fast, high-quality solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate ambiguity.&lt;/strong&gt; Deconstruct broad, ambiguous problem spaces into structured analytical roadmaps, and understand how your work intersects with adjacent systems and teams.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build for scale, not one-offs.&lt;/strong&gt; Build the pipelines, models, dashboards, monitoring, and investigative tooling that make performance visible and reliable. Automate wherever possible; redoing analyses by hand is slow and error-prone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure impact with discipline.&lt;/strong&gt; Design measurement strategies from simple A/B tests to quasi-experimental designs (synthetic control, difference-in-differences, event studies) when trials aren&#39;t feasible, always with conservative, assumption-explicit language.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a first responder.&lt;/strong&gt; Surface deviations before they become escalations, and be just as willing to give the confident &quot;this is noise, no action needed&quot; as the alarm.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate to influence.&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex findings into clear, simple, actionable recommendations for both technical and non-technical audiences that shape roadmaps and decisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the broader Analytics community, improve shared approaches and best practices, and help build data literacy across the business.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate brings strong expertise in some of these areas and the curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience in an analytical or data science role, such as data analytics, data science, forecasting, planning, strategy analytics, or a similar discipline. Experience in logistics, e-commerce, marketplaces, or another fast-moving, customer-focused business is useful but not essential.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with SQL and a scripting language such as Python or R, alongside experience with BI or visualisation tooling such as Looker, Tableau, or similar.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comfortable using modern AI-assisted tools to work efficiently while maintaining high standards of accuracy and reproducibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A pragmatic approach to problem-solving: you can balance analytical rigour with speed, adapt your approach to the importance of the decision, and focus effort where it will have the greatest impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Effective problem-solving: you can take an ambiguous question, identify the underlying problem or decision, develop hypotheses, and use data and business context to reach a clear point of view.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with experimentation and/or causal inference is a strong plus: the ability to unpick insights and steer strategic decisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication skills, in person, in writing, and in code, with the ability to translate business needs into analytical problems and complex findings into simple recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Driven, hard-working, and agile. BizOps sits at the centre of a fast-growing business; we move quickly to scale at pace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;London-based, with a minimum of three days per week in the office.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you&#39;ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that&#39;s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt;: work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt;: ship, test, and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt;: high standards, collaboration, flexible working, and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt;: competitive salary and equity, so you&#39;re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine; our interview typically includes 3 to 4 stages.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo we know that people are the heart of the business and we prioritise their welfare. Benefits differ by country, but we offer many benefits across areas including healthcare, well-being, parental leave, pensions, and generous annual leave allowances, including time off to support a charitable cause of your choice. Benefits are country-specific; please ask your recruiter for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we believe a great workplace is one that represents the world we live in and how beautifully diverse it can be. That means we have no judgement when it comes to any one of the things that make you who you are: your gender, race, sexuality, religion, or a secret aversion to coriander. All you need is a passion for (most) food and a desire to be part of one of the fastest-growing businesses in a rapidly growing industry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are committed to diversity, equity and inclusion in all aspects of our hiring process. If you have a disability or long-term health condition, or require any reasonable adjustments to apply or fairly participate in the interview process, please let us know; we&#39;ll make every effort to ensure you have an equitable opportunity to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Data Science organisation sits at the heart of Deliveroo powering decision-making across our 3 sided marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team (working hybrid, 3 days in the office). In this role, you’ll drive high-quality decision-making to maximise impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring multiple Senior Data Scientists across different areas of the business. Rather than hiring for one fixed team, we use the interview process to understand your strengths, interests and development areas, and then align you to the right scope, remit and team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Our Data Science Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We have an outstanding Data Science organisation, with a mission to drive the highest quality decision-making across our marketplace. We work throughout the company, in product, operations, and platform teams and are uniquely placed to use data to help make better decisions and improve data literacy across Deliveroo. We are great communicators, and move fast to serve our customers a little better every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our community is highly active, with guest lectures, study groups, mentorship programmes and a robust technical review process. Data Scientists can progress equally as IC leads or managers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our data scientists come from all kinds of backgrounds but have excellence in common. Many are formally trained in data science, many are not.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Impact Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; You will independently identify, define, and deliver impactful work that aligns with business goals and metrics, operating with minimal guidance to provide high value to your team and the broader organisation. You will own delivery end-to-end, ensuring the delivery of fast, high-quality, solutions that meet business needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigating Ambiguity and Complexity:&lt;/strong&gt; You will excel at deconstructing broad, ambiguous problem spaces into structured technical roadmaps, managing projects that require both deep team-specific rigour and an understanding of how they intersect with adjacent systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Technical Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive strategic decision-making by selecting the most effective tool or method for the task, maintaining a focus on high-quality execution and measurable results. You will act as a well-trusted strategic partner to stakeholders, using analytics, effective communication and domain expertise to influence roadmaps.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experimentation and measurement: &lt;/strong&gt;Design and lead measurement strategies that drive product direction, ranging from simple A/B tests to complex experimental designs. You will be equally capable of applying alternative causal inference techniques when standard trials aren&#39;t feasible, ensuring the business moves based on data driven insights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisational Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively contribute to the broader Analytics community, driving L+D initiatives and cross-functional collaboration. You will ensure we are delivering the &quot;right&quot; things org-wide by aligning technical work with overarching business strategy and shared best practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Significant experience in Data Science (or similar) roles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A pragmatic and adaptable approach, with a strong focus on delivering impact efficiently at pace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excellent people skills — you&#39;ll be meeting with a range of both technical and non-technical stakeholders to translate business needs into data science problems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience leading both simple and more complex experiment designs, with the ability to proactively unpick insights to steer strategic decision making&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Great communication skills - in person, in writing, in code; to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Through solid analysis, provide clear and actionable recommendations that influence the team&#39;s roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Effective problem-solving, demonstrating an ability to successfully address complex and ambiguous challenges.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ability to think creatively and insightfully about business problems&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with analytical tools like R/Python and familiarity with SQL. Proficiency with Cursor/AI tools to deliver impactful, high quality work efficiently is also valued&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;br&gt;      &lt;/strong&gt;Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🌱&lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;br&gt;     &lt;/strong&gt;Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership&lt;br&gt;     environment.&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;br&gt;     &lt;/strong&gt;Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎A culture built for builders&lt;br&gt;     &lt;/strong&gt;High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;​​&lt;strong&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;     Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you&lt;br&gt;     Make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about&lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;how we hire here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;#LI-ES1&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to transform the way you shop and eat, bringing the neighbourhood to your door by connecting consumers, restaurants, shops and riders. We are transforming the way the world eats and shops by making access to food and products more convenient and enjoyable. We give people the opportunity to buy what they want, as they want it, when and where they want it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a technology-driven company at the forefront of the most rapidly expanding industry in the world. We are still a small team, making a very large impact, looking to answer some of the most interesting questions out there. We move fast, value autonomy and ownership, and we are always looking for new ideas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Corporate Security Engineer, you will lead the design and operation of security controls that protect our internal networks, workforce identities, endpoints and corporate systems. You will be working globally with security teams across US, EU and APAC, delivering against our goals and objectives - reducing risk and maturing controls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior, you will operate with a high degree of autonomy. You will define technical direction, make architectural decisions, and deliver complex security initiatives end-to-end. You will be expected to balance risk reduction with usability, ensuring controls are robust without impeding employee productivity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role focuses on Identity and Access Management (IAM), Endpoint security (EDR), Network Security, logging and detection engineering, and secure SaaS enablement. You will work closely with IT, Legal, Privacy, Engineering and business stakeholders to embed security as a default practice across the organisation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Security controls will be aligned to recognised frameworks such as the CIS Critical Security Controls and the NIST Cybersecurity Framework (CSF).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Control Implementation: &lt;/strong&gt;Design, deploy, and maintain core corporate security controls, including phishing-resistant MFA, Just-In-Time (JIT) access, strict role-based access control (RBAC), zero-trust architectures, device and identity bound proofing and modern network isolation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tooling Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the technical owner for a broad suite of corporate security systems, managing deployments, configurations, and API integrations for tools across the corporate environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and implement the technical strategy for Endpoint Device trust, Data Loss Prevention, Intellectual property storage, and SaaS application security. Alongside wider corporate security technical controls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Engineering: &lt;/strong&gt;Write scripts and build tools to automate security workflows, incident response tasks, and audit evidence collection for compliance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Work with IT and business operations to integrate security tools into everyday workflows. Guide non-security teams to adopt secure baselines (e.g., CIS Benchmarks) as standard practice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor junior and mid-level engineers, explain technical concepts clearly to non-technical staff, and help improve the team&#39;s engineering standards.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Cybersecurity, Information Technology, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;5+ years’ experience in Security Engineering, Corporate Security, Detection &amp;amp; Response, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience administering IAM platforms (e.g. Okta, GoogleWorkspace).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deep hands-on experience with GoogleWorkspace products&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Practical hands-on experience with Cloud platforms (e.g AWS, GCP)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Relevant and practical experience with Infrastructure-as-code (e.g Terraform)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience implementing modern authentication standards (FIDO2, WebAuthn, SAML, OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Practical experience securing macOS, Windows and Linux endpoints using MDM and EDR/XDR tooling.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience operating SIEM and/or SOAR platforms and tuning detection logic.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with vulnerability management and patch governance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ability to write production-quality automation scripts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated experience leading cross-functional technical initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with SASE or Zero Trust Network Access platforms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hands on experience deploying applications into K8 and Docker environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Data Loss Prevention (DLP) and SaaS security governance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Advanced detection engineering or SOAR playbook development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience supporting ISO 27001 or SOC 2 audits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Relevant certifications (e.g. CISSP, CISM, GIAC).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo we know that people are the heart of the business and we prioritise their welfare. Benefits differ by country, but we offer many benefits in areas including healthcare, well-being, parental leave, pensions, and generous annual leave allowances, including time off to support a charitable cause of your choice. Benefits are country-specific, please ask your recruiter for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we believe a great workplace is one that represents the world we live in and how beautifully diverse it can be. That means we have no judgement when it comes to any one of the things that make you who you are - your gender, race, sexuality, religion or a secret aversion to coriander. All you need is a passion for (most) food and a desire to be part of one of the fastest-growing businesses in a rapidly growing industry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are committed to diversity, equity and inclusion in all aspects of our hiring process. We recognise that some candidates may require adjustments to apply for a position or fairly participate in the interview process. If you require any adjustments, please don&#39;t hesitate to let us know. We will make every effort to provide the necessary adjustments to ensure you have an equitable opportunity to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;B2B Marketing Operations sits within Commercial Operations, and owns the end-to-end execution and orchestration of partner communications across email, WhatsApp and tablet notifications. We also own the lifecycle and automation stack behind those communications (Salesforce Marketing Cloud), and the campaign performance reporting that shows what&#39;s working. In 2026, the team is shifting from operational excellence to strategic orchestration: connecting channels, segmentation and measurement to drive partner growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior B2B Marketing Operations Executive to own both the technical build and the strategic design of our partner lifecycle programmes. In the first 90 days, you&#39;ll get hands-on with our Salesforce Marketing Cloud builds, audience SQL and campaign QA process, taking ownership of live campaign execution. Over the following months, you&#39;ll take on end-to-end ownership of lifecycle programme design — using performance data to shape segmentation, messaging and cadence — while continuing to support ad-hoc partner sends as they come up. You will report into the Marketing Operations Manager on our B2B Marketing Operations team in our Commercial Operations organization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Own end-to-end execution of partner lifecycle and ad-hoc email/WhatsApp campaigns, from audience build through to send and QA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Design and continuously improve lifecycle programmes, using performance data to iterate on messaging, cadence and segmentation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain SQL-based audience queries, AMPscript personalisation and HTML email templates within Salesforce Marketing Cloud&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Track and report on campaign and lifecycle performance metrics, turning results into clear recommendations for the wider team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner with stakeholders across Commercial, Content and Data teams to scope and prioritise campaign requests&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience building and executing email campaigns in an enterprise marketing automation platform (e.g., Salesforce Marketing Cloud highly preferred)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proficiency writing SQL queries to build and troubleshoot audience segments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with HTML and a scripting/templating language (e.g., AMPscript, Liquid) for email personalisation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience designing lifecycle or CRM marketing programmes and tracking their performance against defined metrics&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strong written communication skills and the ability to manage multiple concurrent campaign requests&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Product team defines how millions of people experience Deliveroo, turning complex marketplace challenges into simple, high-impact solutions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working at the intersection of data, design and engineering, we set direction, prioritise what matters most, and deliver outcomes that move the business forward.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Product Manager to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us own the vision, strategy, and execution for Double Order—transforming one of our most exciting consumer bets into a scaled, lasting part of how people use Deliveroo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the Double Order team. Double Order allows customers to add a second restaurant or store to a single delivery, sitting directly at the intersection of customer experience, marketplace economics, and real-world logistics. You will be responsible for balancing these forces to find creative, high-impact moves that grow the business and delight customers simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own vision and strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and execute the end-to-end roadmap and OKRs for Double Order, taking it from early discovery through to a scaled, sustainable product.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance complex marketplace dynamics:&lt;/strong&gt; Solve for customer value and business growth alongside the underlying economics and logistics required to make multi-order journeys viable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Engineering, Design, Data, Logistics, Finance, and Market teams to ship, learn, and iterate at pace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Combine data with strong judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead experiment-driven development, navigating incomplete information, and knowing when to incrementally optimise versus completely rethink an approach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align senior stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; Communicate strategy, trade-offs, and key learnings clearly to build wide organisation-level conviction in your domain&#39;s direction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Essential Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated product ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of delivering measurable outcomes for consumer-facing products operating at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Broad domain experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Breadth across multiple stages of the customer journey (e.g. checkout, discovery, pricing, retention) with an ability to connect strategic dots across complex systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigating ambiguity and trade-offs:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience taking ownership of high-stakes, ambiguous problems and balancing competing business priorities within a marketplace, platform, or low-margin environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical and commercial rigour:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong quantitative skills paired with sound business instincts to validate hypotheses and make consequential calls.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional and stakeholder leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to build trust across multidisciplinary teams (Engineering, Design, Data, Operations, Finance) and align senior stakeholders on difficult trade-offs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Clear, concise written and verbal communication skills with the ability to articulate complex strategies with conviction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with bundling, multi-order, or complex marketplace logistics products.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deep familiarity with large-scale experimentation frameworks and product development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;deliveroo.engineering&quot;&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;It’s an exciting time to join our rapidly growing Accounting team with ample development opportunities. We&#39;re growing the Revenue Data team with Engineering and Accounting Data openings to drive our automation and systems infrastructure and while keeping pace within one of the fastest growing marketplace companies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Manager of Engineering for Accounting Infrastructure and Systems leads a team responsible for building and maintaining the scalable backend systems, data pipelines, and integrations that power DoorDash&#39;s accounting, reconciliation, and financial reporting workflows. This role partners closely with Finance, Accounting, and cross-functional engineering teams to translate complex regulatory and operational requirements into reliable, automated platforms that ensure accuracy, auditability, and compliance at scale. The ideal candidate combines strong technical leadership and distributed-systems expertise with a deep understanding of financial processes, while mentoring engineers and driving the strategic roadmap for the company&#39;s accounting technology stack. You will report into the Senior Manager, M&amp;amp;A Accounting (Data) on our Accounting Revenue Data team in our Finance organization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Own the strategic roadmap and execution for DoorDash&#39;s accounting infrastructure, including the data pipelines, system integrations, and automation platforms that power financial reporting, reconciliation, and compliance at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner with Accounting, Finance, and cross-functional engineering teams to translate complex regulatory and operational requirements into reliable, auditable backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lead and mentor a team of engineers, setting technical direction and fostering a high-performance culture within a fast-moving, high-stakes financial environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive measurable improvements in data accuracy, pipeline reliability, and system scalability — directly enabling faster close cycles and audit readiness across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You have 7+ years of experience in data or software engineering, including 2+ years leading engineering teams, ideally within fintech, marketplace, or high-growth tech environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You bring hands-on expertise with modern data infrastructure tools (e.g., Fivetran, dbt Cloud, Snowflake, Workato) and can credibly guide technical decisions across the stack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You have a strong working knowledge of financial processes — including revenue recognition, reconciliation, and close workflows — and can bridge the gap between engineering and accounting stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a clear communicator who can align diverse partners (Finance, Accounting, Compliance, Engineering) around complex technical tradeoffs and delivery timelines.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with distributed systems, data quality frameworks, and SOX-relevant controls is a strong plus.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At DoorDash, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a massive marketplace that’s constantly evolving. By joining our London-based team on a Deliveroo contract, you get the unique advantage of working within a vibrant local business environment while directly blueprinting global-scale processes for the broader DoorDash Inc. group.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re problem solvers, community builders, and innovators, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for merchants, consumers, partners, and dashers/riders worldwide by building clean, frictionless operational workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace, and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role:&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills, and grow as the global business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;DoorDash brings together brands and teams with massive reach, scale, and ambition. In this role, you &lt;strong&gt;will&lt;/strong&gt; collaborate directly with teammates, systems, and leaders across our entire global footprint, including Deliveroo, Wolt, and DoorDash US. Together, we are unlocking new possibilities and driving global impact as one unified team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;We know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;#LI-ID1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning Engineer - Growth &amp;amp; Personalisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Global Engineering teams tackle complex technical challenges across a global, three-sided marketplace, building and scaling systems that serve millions of customers, riders and partners every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Machine Learning Engineer to join our London office as part of a Global DoorDash Engineering team (working hybrid, 3 days in the office).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our New Verticals team exists to grow monthly active usage outside of restaurant ordering — groceries, retail, and everything in between. That means turning someone who only orders restaurant food into someone who also uses the app for a grocery run, and turning dormant users into active ones. You&#39;ll work on the surfaces that make that happen: the homepage, vertical landing pages, and the notifications that bring people back. This role sits closer to the personalisation and ranking side of that mission, working alongside colleagues across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build and improve ranking models for vertical landing pages (grocery, retail), deciding what a user sees first when they land on a store page&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Design models that blend new-vertical content into a homepage built around restaurant ordering, without disrupting the core experience&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build personalisation models that translate a user&#39;s existing behaviour into relevant recommendations for verticals they haven&#39;t tried yet&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Contribute to notification targeting — who gets notified, with what message, and when, to drive adoption of new verticals&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Minimum 3+ years of experience as an ML Engineer or Data Scientist, with a proven ability to write high-quality production code in Python&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience with end-to-end model productionisation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A bias to simplicity, where you care most about achieving impact&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Background in personalisation, ranking, or recommender systems; exposure to causal inference or uplift modelling is a genuine plus but not expected&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you&#39;ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that&#39;s constantly evolving. We&#39;re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;br&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast&lt;br&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;br&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders&lt;br&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create&lt;br&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you&#39;re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our Tech Blog.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we&#39;re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We&#39;re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to let us know once you&#39;ve submitted your application. We&#39;ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drive everything we do.  As part of our unified &lt;strong&gt;global Fintech organization across Deliveroo and Wolt (DoorDash International)&lt;/strong&gt;, our team shapes and scales the RegTech &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Group Product Manager to lead the teams building Wolt, Deliveroo’s and DoorDash’s global regulatory and compliance technology in London.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with legal, finance, engineering, and other teams to translate regulatory needs into robust product solutions. This includes everything from anti-money laundering (AML) and safeguarding to tax and licensing compliance across 40+ markets. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll define the long-term product strategy for our compliance stack. Including building internal tools, APIs, and automation for regulatory requirements like KYC, AML, and audit readiness.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead and grow a group of senior Product Managers, guiding their work across multiple roadmaps and domains. Together, you&#39;ll solve the most critical regulatory and financial compliance challenges in our business.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll also work closely with teams like Licensing Services, Tax, Legal, and Finance to understand changing rules and requirements, and ensure we build the right solutions to stay ahead.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You could come to this role from different backgrounds, but ideally, you bring:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A strong grasp of EU regulatory frameworks such as AML/CTF, KYC and KYB, Payments Regulations, Tax regulations, Invoicing and e-Invoicing systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience turning legal requirements into product designs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience leading other Product Managers or Product Leads, including setting direction across multiple teams, coaching individuals, and aligning senior stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High level of technical and analytical fluency. You are comfortable working with APIs, data models, audits, and reporting workflows&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with financial services infrastructure, such as KYC, KYB and AML systems, licensing processes, scalable invoicing platforms incl e-Invoicing and core banking platforms&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, including experience influencing executives and cross-functional teams across legal, finance, and engineering&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A track record of operating in high-ambiguity environments, navigating risk, and delivering product impact without full information&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fintech &amp;amp; Payments Subject Matter Expertise: Minimum 8–12 years of overall Product Management experience, with a significant portion dedicated to the Fintech or Financial Services sector&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ability to communicate effectively across all levels of the organization&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to transform the way you shop and eat, bringing the neighbourhood to your door by connecting consumers, restaurants, shops and riders. We are transforming the way the world eats and shops by making access to food and products more convenient and enjoyable. We give people the opportunity to buy what they want, as they want it, when and where they want it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a technology-driven company at the forefront of the most rapidly expanding industry in the world. We are still a small team, making a very large impact, looking to answer some of the most interesting questions out there. We move fast, value autonomy and ownership, and we are always looking for new ideas.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo we know that people are the heart of the business and we prioritise their welfare. Benefits differ by country, but we offer many benefits in areas including healthcare, well-being, parental leave, pensions, and generous annual leave allowances, including time off to support a charitable cause of your choice. Benefits are country-specific, please ask your recruiter for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we believe a great workplace is one that represents the world we live in and how beautifully diverse it can be. That means we have no judgement when it comes to any one of the things that make you who you are - your gender, race, sexuality, religion or a secret aversion to coriander. All you need is a passion for (most) food and a desire to be part of one of the fastest-growing businesses in a rapidly growing industry.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are committed to diversity, equity and inclusion in all aspects of our hiring process. We recognise that some candidates may require adjustments to apply for a position or fairly participate in the interview process. If you require any adjustments, please don&#39;t hesitate to let us know. We will make every effort to provide the necessary adjustments to ensure you have an equitable opportunity to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Finance &amp;amp; Strategy Senior Associate&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our Finance team shapes the company&#39;s future by directing capital to high-impact investments, developing robust financial strategies, and ensuring we deliver long-term value while pursuing our ambitious mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Finance &amp;amp; Strategy Senior Associate&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you’ll work with partners across Deliveroo to ensure we are making efficient, data-driven decisions that evaluate the effectiveness of our products and unlock new avenues for growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-finance-team/&quot;&gt;Finance&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll be joining the &lt;strong&gt;Finance &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; team. We accelerate the growth of our business by implementing new opportunities and solutions, partnering across the company to improve the profitability and scalability of our business model.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer Product Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate the effectiveness of high-impact consumer products at scale and develop creative growth strategies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Modelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Build custom financial models tailored to specific business needs to improve high-stakes strategic decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Framework Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with stakeholders to develop new investment decision-making frameworks and processes in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Track and analyse key business and financial KPIs, uncovering trends to assess risks and future opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Scaling:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead special projects to automate and scale reporting tools, investment frameworks, and cost-tracking methodologies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Finance Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant experience in strategic finance, corporate finance, or investment banking, ideally within the high-growth technology sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Modelling Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; High proficiency in Excel with a proven ability to build robust financial models and perform complex analyses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in SQL (or a strong willingness to learn) to manipulate large data sets and uncover hidden insights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of budget management and the ability to partner with cross-functional teams to drive operational value.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to operate effectively in a dynamic, evolving environment that values autonomy and ownership.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Data Science Manager&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Data Science organisation sits at the heart of Deliveroo, powering decision-making across product, commercial and operational teams through experimentation and causal inference.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring multiple Data Science Managers across different areas of the business. All of these roles are at the same level. Rather than hiring for one fixed team, we use the interview process to understand your strengths, interests and development areas, and then align you to the right scope and team at the end of the process, based on your background, interview performance, preferences and current business needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re also advertising some opportunities separately where particular domain experience is especially relevant. You only need to submit one application, as we’ll consider your profile across all suitable Data Science Manager vacancies. Before an offer is made, you’ll have the opportunity to meet the proposed team, either virtually or at our London headquarters, and learn more about the role’s scope and priorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the analytical direction and measurable impact of a product or business area, while leading and developing a high-performing team of data scientists or machine learning engineers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our Data Science Managers work across a range of consumer, product and commercial areas. Depending on the team you join, your work could focus on areas such as customer retention and loyalty, pricing and promotions, discovery and personalisation, or customer acquisition and engagement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Across all roles, you’ll lead and develop your team, set the analytical direction for your area and decide which problems are worth solving. You’ll ensure data science work translates into better product and commercial decisions, not just analysis.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll remain hands-on while managing a team, partnering with Product, Engineering, Ops, Marketing and Finance as a thought partner. You’ll set the bar for analytical rigour, prioritisation and impact across noisy metrics, real trade-offs and strong stakeholder opinions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience line managing data scientists and supporting their career development&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A strong background as a senior individual contributor, with hands-on experience in experimentation, causal inference or applied machine learning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proven ability to identify high-impact opportunities and turn insights into clear strategy and execution&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Confidence working with senior stakeholders and explaining complex technical concepts to non-technical audiences&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comfort operating in fast-moving, ambiguous environments where prioritisation and judgement matter as much as technical skill&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll work on real-world problems at global scale, across a three-sided marketplace that is constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community organisers and more, united by a shared drive to make things better. Working here, you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;High autonomy to shape strategy and deliver meaningful impact&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Support to learn and grow through L&amp;amp;D programmes, mentoring and peer learning&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A strong focus on wellbeing, with benefits that vary by country&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;A place to belong, with a diverse global workforce and active employee communities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we believe great workplaces reflect the world around us. We welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you require adjustments at any stage of the application or interview process, please let us know. We’re committed to ensuring everyone has an equitable opportunity to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to own impact and shape how decisions are made at Deliveroo? Apply today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Analytics organisation sits at the heart of Deliveroo powering decision-making across our 3 sided marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Analytics Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our London team. This is a hybrid role, with 3 days per week on-site. In this role, you’ll lead a team of Analytics Engineers embedded in a key business domain, owning the pipelines, models and metrics that power day-to-day decisions and building the data foundations your stakeholders rely on.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Analytics Engineering Org&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Analytics Engineering is a core pillar of Deliveroo’s Analytics organisation, alongside Data Science. With over 70 Analytics Engineers across the UK and India, we are embedded directly within product and business domains, owning the pipelines, models and metrics that power decision-making at scale: from self-serve AI-enabled analytics and experimentation through to executive reporting and strategic planning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The discipline is evolving fast. With new tooling changing how we work, we are shifting from building data pipelines to building AI first data products, developing rich semantic and data context layers and empowering self-serve data users. This role leads that work across a defined business domain, directly managing a team of Analytics Engineers and helping shape AE standards, culture and direction across the wider org.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Directly lead a team of Analytics Engineers embedded in a defined business domain, owning their performance, development and wellbeing&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Own the AE roadmap for your domain, identifying the highest-leverage investments, prioritising competing requests, and building the case for them with your business and product stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive a data products mindset across your estate: clear ownership, SLAs, observability and data contracts built into how your team works by default&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Maintain strong technical involvement: reviewing data models and SQL, guiding architectural decisions, and stepping in hands-on when your team needs unblocking&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Contribute to AE-wide decisions on tooling, standards and process, helping shape how Analytics Engineering works at Deliveroo beyond your immediate team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a high-performing, inclusive team culture by giving regular and actionable feedback, handling performance and motivation challenges, and running effective rituals&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Partner with Recruiting to hire strong, diverse AE talent into your team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience in an Analytics Engineering, BI Engineering, or Data Engineering role, with strong, hands-on SQL foundations you still draw on regularly&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Proven experience managing a team of ICs, with a track record of developing people, giving hard feedback, and handling typical team situations independently&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to own a technical roadmap for a domain area and deliver against it with measurable business impact&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strong grounding across the modern AE stack (cloud data warehousing, transformation tooling, data modelling, and data quality practices), with the ability to engage credibly on technical decisions and unblock your team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Comfortable engaging and influencing at senior business and product level, with experience aligning analytics investment to domain priorities&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience in a marketplace, e-commerce, grocery or retail analytics context&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with semantic and metrics layer tooling, or Python for data automation and pipeline work&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Exposure to AI for Data, including agentic AI methods, semantic layers, or AI-assisted analytics workflows&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience contributing to analytics ways of working: documentation standards, peer review processes, onboarding, and knowledge sharing&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;br&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;🌱&lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;br&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership&lt;br&gt; environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong&gt;🧠Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;br&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎A culture built for builders&lt;br&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;​​&lt;strong&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Revlon, we create beauty innovations for everyone that inspire confidence and ignite joy every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Breaking beauty boundaries is in our company’s DNA. Since its game-changing launch of the first opaque nail enamel in 1932 (and later, the first long-wear foundation), Revlon has provided consumers with high-quality product innovation, performance, and sophisticated glamour. Elizabeth Arden made waves as a woman-led beauty company in the 1920s. In 1931, Almay became the original hypoallergenic, fragrance-free beauty brand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, Revlon resiliently continues its legacy as a leading global beauty company. Our diverse portfolio—which consists of some of the world’s most iconic brands and product offerings in color cosmetics, skincare, hair color &amp;amp; care, personal care, and fragrances—is sold around the world through prestige, professional, mass, and direct-to-consumer retail channels. These brands include Revlon, Revlon Professional, Elizabeth Arden, Almay, American Crew, CND, Cutex, Mitchum, Sinful Colors, Creme of Nature, Christina Aguilera, John Varvatos, Juicy Couture, Ed Hardy and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We honor our heritage, embrace change, and applaud diversity. We champion our employees and celebrate our consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Revlon, together, transforming beauty.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is a Hybrid Role:&lt;/strong&gt; Employees are expected to work from our London Head Office in Mornington Crescent, NW1, 3 days per week (Mon, Wed, Thurs) and may work remotely the remaining days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an ambitious and commercially driven Senior National Account Manager to join our UK Mass Sales team. This is an exciting opportunity to manage key grocery accounts, drive profitable growth, and play a pivotal role in delivering our sales strategy across a portfolio of leading beauty and personal care brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will be an experienced Account Manager with a strong background in FMCG sales, preferably within the grocery sector, and a proven track record of delivering sales, profit and market share growth through effective customer partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will take full ownership of major customer relationships, leading negotiations, developing Joint Business Plans, and working cross-functionally to deliver best-in-class commercial execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brand Responsibilities include;&amp;nbsp;Revlon Cosmetics, Mitchum, Cutex, Crème of Nature + More&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver sales, profit and market share targets across designated grocery accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic Joint Business Plans (JBPs) aligned to both customer and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead annual commercial negotiations, including trading terms, promotional plans and investment agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage full customer P&amp;amp;L responsibility, ensuring profitable and sustainable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with key stakeholders across customer organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse sales performance, stockholding, forecasts and market trends to identify opportunities and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver accurate sales, volume and financial forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Marketing, Supply Chain, Finance and Customer Service teams to ensure successful execution of plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and optimise promotional performance and return on investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage invoice and credit-related activities to maintain account health and commercial compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insights and recommendations to support wider business decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in a National Account Manager or Senior National Account Manager role within FMCG. Minimum 4+ Years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering sales growth and profit targets within a fast-paced FMCG environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent commercial acumen with strong P&amp;amp;L management capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced negotiation and influencing skills, with experience leading annual trading negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing Joint Business Plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to interpret data and translate insights into actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build effective relationships both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent forecasting, planning and organisational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applicant Data Protection Disclosure:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you apply to a job on this site, the personal data contained in your application will be collected by Revlon Consumer Products LLC (“Controller”), and its operating affiliates.&amp;nbsp;Revlon Consumer Products LLC&#39;s data protection officer is Monica Fahnhorst, who can be contacted at &lt;a ---------- Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller’s recruitment related activities, which include setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating, and assessing the results thereto, and as is otherwise needed in the recruitment and hiring processes. Such processing is legally permissible under Art. 6(1)(f) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation) as necessary for the purposes of the legitimate interests pursued by the Controller, which are the solicitation, evaluation, and selection of applicants for employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider located in the United States of America and engaged by Controller to help manage its recruitment and hiring process on Controller’s behalf. Accordingly, if you are located outside of the United States, your personal data will be transferred to the United States once you submit it through this site. Greenhouse is certified to the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework, which the European Commission has determined ensures an adequate level of protection – comparable to that of the EU – for personal data transferred from the EU.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Controller for three (3) years. Under the GDPR, you have the right to request access to your personal data, to request that your personal data be rectified or erased, and to request that processing of your personal data be restricted. You also have to right to data portability. In addition, you may lodge a complaint with an EU supervisory authority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;opportunity-equal-opportunity-employer-description&quot; data-automation=&quot;job-pay-transparency-policy-statement&quot; data-bind=&quot;visible: $parent.shouldShowPayTransparencyStatemet, text: PayTransparencyPolicyStatement&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0650/1328/5059/files/Applicant_Privacy_Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;opportunity-equal-opportunity-employer-description&quot; data-automation=&quot;job-pay-transparency-policy-statement&quot; data-bind=&quot;visible: $parent.shouldShowPayTransparencyStatemet, text: PayTransparencyPolicyStatement&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.revlon.com/policies/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy policy – Revlon&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Vinted we are devoted to making second-hand the first choice worldwide. Vinted Pay is the regulated payments entity that makes it possible through enabling Vinted users to spend money, receive money, keep money and payout, while keeping them safe from financial crime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are establishing a new AML &amp;amp; Fraud Prevention product domain within Vinted Pay. As a regulated financial institution operating across Europe, our obligations grow as we grow: anti-money laundering and counter-terrorist financing controls, sanctions screening, KYC, transaction monitoring are protecting our members and our balance sheet from fraud and other illegal activities. Today these capabilities sit across several teams and tools. This domain will own them end to end, and turn financial crime prevention into a mature product: controls that satisfy regulators without adding friction for the honest majority.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a newly created domain. As its leader you will work with your functional peers (Engineering, Data, Design) to assess the status quo and construct the long-term vision. You will be responsible for setting domain goals, delivering on already identified opportunities, hiring, and executing the product vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to the leader of Engineering/Product/Design/Analytics at Vinted Pay, and partner with Product Directors across Vinted Pay and the wider marketplace, as well as with our Compliance, Legal, Risk, Risk Operations, Engineering, Design and Analytics functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive and align the AML &amp;amp; Fraud Prevention domain on a single, unified vision, expressed through measurable objectives and key results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product roadmap across AML/CTF, sanctions and PEP screening, KYC, transaction monitoring and fraud prevention, build alignment across product teams, cross-functional partners and the leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our MLRO, Compliance, Risk and Legal teams to translate regulatory obligations into product requirements and make the case for automated solutions where manual controls are in place&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple competing objectives and provide clarity to the delivering organisation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use and analyse data to size risk, identify product opportunities, and build the right capabilities at the right time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own build-vs-buy decisions, then assess and collaborate with the vendors in building and maintaining AML/Fraud prevention solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get ahead of regulatory change: the EU AML package and AMLA, PSD3/PSR, evolving sanctions regimes, rather than reacting to it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, mentor, lead and scale a team of Product Managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement best in class product development and managerial practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in product management, with a substantial part of it in AML, financial crime, compliance, risk or fraud, ideally at a regulated financial institution, e-money institution, PSP, bank or fintech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of developing people and managing teams, including Product Managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep working knowledge of the AML domain: KYC and identity verification, customer risk scoring, sanctions and PEP screening, transaction monitoring and alert handling, SAR/STR reporting, and the regulatory frameworks behind them (EU AML directives and the AML package, national transpositions, FATF standards)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with fraud and scam prevention: detection models and rules engines, account takeover controls, chargebacks and disputes, and the trade-off between loss reduction and false positives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of successful product launches (at least two substantial projects with a 6–9 month minimum duration)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a regulated environment: you have worked alongside compliance officers, internal and external auditors and supervisors, and you know how to move quickly without creating regulatory exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to deliver from 0 to 1, and not afraid to build your own tools to achieve your goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional leadership skills and substantial experience building high-performing teams of 10+, ideally not only in product (and we’d expect your former teams to still be singing your praises!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significantly above-average business acumen, analytical skills and long-term planning skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Both quantitative and qualitative: able to assess and understand complex systems quickly, to integrate usability studies, research and market analysis into product requirements, and to be a product ambassador to the rest of the organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well organised, with a collaborative attitude and a strong sense of ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent communicator, including in written and spoken English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a discounted gym membership plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Life and Income Protection Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A matched pension scheme up to a set limit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan with the opportunity to choose your contribution percentage, and Vinted will match it up to a set limit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£105,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£143,200 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW28567526 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW28567526 BCX8&quot;&gt;Our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW28567526 BCX8&quot;&gt;Economics and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW28567526 BCX8&quot;&gt;Regulation&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW28567526 BCX8&quot;&gt;practice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW28567526 BCX8&quot;&gt; is looking for an experienced Consultant or Senior Consultant to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW28567526 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt;We are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt; looking for Consultants and Senior Consultants to join one of the UK’s largest specialist regulatory economics teams. We advise energy, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt;water&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt; and other &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt;regulated-industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt; clients, as well as governments, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt;regulators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt; and investors, on complex regulatory, policy and investment decisions. Our work includes price controls, regulatory strategy and submissions, utility business planning, market and incentive design, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt;decarbonisation&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt;programmes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt;, investment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt;cases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot;&gt; and wider economic analysis. You will gain exposure to major infrastructure and energy-transition challenges across multiple sectors, working alongside collaborative specialists to turn robust analysis into practical, high-impact recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW88772428 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
