y business planning; financial modelling; cost-benefit analysis or investment appraisal; energy transition or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW57200565 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;decarbonisation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW57200565 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;; government or regulator roles; electricity, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW57200565 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;gas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW57200565 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; or water networks; or commercial consulting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
