&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px; color: #34515a;&quot;&gt;Work with talented colleagues across markets, functions, and offices who care deeply about travel and impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: 100%; max-width: 300px; margin: 0 12px 12px 0; border: 1px solid #F3D6CF; border-radius: 12px; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 14px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; color: #024251; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;💡 Driven by technology&lt;/div&gt;
