&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and execute structured test plans for robotic components, modules, and fully integrated systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate functionality, robustness, and performance of software and hardware in real robotic platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Python-based test scripts, tools, and automation frameworks to improve testing efficiency and coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute C++ code when required for low-level testing, tooling, or integration support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze robot behavior and system performance, identifying root causes for issues related to kinematics, motion planning, control, perception, or hardware interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and debug complex robotic behaviors such as singularities, joint limit violations, trajectory instabilities, and configuration inconsistencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with URDF models, coordinate transformations, and robot descriptions to validate system correctness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development and refinement of application demos, internal showcases, and customer-facing use cases• Collaborate closely with software, electronics, controls, and mechanical teams to reproduce issues and validate fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document test procedures, results, defects, and system performance in a clear and structured manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to continuous improvement of testing strategies, coverage, and automation infrastructure• Support field tests, prototype validation, demos and integration activities when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
