&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3018&quot; data-end=&quot;3287&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v2ttr4&quot; data-start=&quot;3018&quot; data-end=&quot;3062&quot;&gt;Is entrepreneurial, hands-on, and driven&lt;/li&gt;
