&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1pw1999&quot; data-start=&quot;3755&quot; data-end=&quot;3777&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3758&quot; data-end=&quot;3777&quot;&gt;Why Join ROB’E?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3778&quot; data-end=&quot;4091&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tdwgj1&quot; data-start=&quot;3778&quot; data-end=&quot;3847&quot;&gt;Build a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3788&quot; data-end=&quot;3825&quot;&gt;category-defining MedTech company&lt;/strong&gt; from an early stage&lt;/li&gt;
